{#
  BeMart admin ClassCategory list — EC-CUBE goClassCategoryList (規格分類管理).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `Product/class_category.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/Product/class_category.twig).

  Product section, LIST + inline-FORM page. It extends the admin frame
  (`admin-base.html.twig`). The markup skeleton + `c-*` / `ec-*` /
  Bootstrap classes are kept verbatim from EC-CUBE; only the dynamic
  bindings are rebound to the ClassCategoryList resource body
  (src/Resource/Page/Admin/ClassCategory/ClassCategoryList.php — body
  carries `classNameId`, `classCategories` (a list of {classCategoryId,
  classNameId, name}), `count` and an AdminClassCategoryForm exposed as
  `form`).

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md, "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `canonical-url route, params)` -> deterministic `/{route}?{query}`.
   - `form_widget(form.name)` / `form.backend_name` ->
     `form.input('name')` / `form.input('backend_name')` — the real
     AdminClassCategoryForm inline-create inputs (Ray.WebFormModule).
   - `form_widget(form._token)` -> EC-CUBE per-request CSRF widget; the
     hidden `_token` input is kept with an empty value (residual).
   - `{% for ClassCategory in ClassCategories %}` -> the body's
     `classCategories` list. `ClassCategory.id` / `.name` -> the
     projection keys `classCategoryId` / `name`.
   - `ClassName` header card (`ClassName.name` / `ClassName.backend_name`)
     -> the ClassCategoryList resource carries only the parent
     `classNameId`, NOT the parent ClassName's name / backend label
     (Wave 7 slice). The header card renders the id but the name /
     backend cells render empty. FLAGGED for enrichment follow-up.
   - `ClassCategory.backend_name`, `ClassCategory.sortNo`,
     `ClassCategory.visible` -> the AdminClassCategoryListFetched
     projection carries only `classCategoryId` / `classNameId` / `name`;
     the backend label, sort_no and visible flag are NOT projected
     (Wave 7 shallow-list slice). The backend label / `data-sort-no` /
     the visible-toggle state render empty / default. FLAGGED for
     enrichment follow-up.
   - per-row `forms[ClassCategory.id]` inline-EDIT form -> the per-row
     edit is `doUpdateClassCategory` at a sibling resource; the list
     resource carries no per-row form. The `mode-edit` collapse panel
     keeps EC-CUBE's structure but renders plain `<input>`s. Enumerated
     as residual.
   - `csrf_token_for_anchor()` -> EC-CUBE per-request CSRF widget;
     OMITTED.
#}
{% extends 'admin-base.html.twig' %}

{% set route = 'admin-class-category-class-category-list' %}
{% set title = '規格分類管理' %}
{% set sub_title = '商品管理' %}

{% block stylesheet %}
    <style type="text/css">
        .list-group-item:hover {
            z-index: inherit;
        }
    </style>
{% endblock stylesheet %}
{% block javascript %}
    <script type="text/javascript">
        $(function() {
            // 初期表示時のsort noを保持.
            var oldSortNos = [];
            var sortable = $('.sortable-item');
            sortable.each(function() {
                oldSortNos.push(this.dataset.sortNo);
            });
            oldSortNos.sort(function(a, b) {
                return a - b;
            }).reverse();
            // 並び替え後にsort noを更新
            var updateSortNo = function() {
                var newSortNos = {};
                var i = 0;
                $('.sortable-item').each(function() {
                    newSortNos[this.dataset.id] = oldSortNos[i];
                    i++;
                });
                $.ajax({
                    url: '/admin/sort-no-move?masterType=classCategory&_method=put',
                    type: 'POST',
                    data: newSortNos
                }).always(function() {
                    $(".modal-backdrop").remove();
                });
            };
            // 最初と最後の↑↓を再描画
            var redrawDisableAllows = function() {
                var items = $('.sortable-item');
                items.find('a').removeClass('disabled');
                items.first().find('a.action-up').addClass('disabled');
                items.last().find('a.action-down').addClass('disabled');
            };
            // オーバレイ後, 表示順の更新を行う
            var moveSortNo = function() {
                $('body').append($('<div class="modal-backdrop show"></div>'));
                updateSortNo();
                redrawDisableAllows();
            };
            // Drag and Drop
            $('.sortable-container').sortable({
                items: '> .sortable-item',
                cursor: 'move',
                update: function(e, ui) {
                    moveSortNo();
                }
            });
            // Up
            sortable.on('click', 'a.action-up', function(e) {
                e.preventDefault();
                var current = $(this).parents('li');
                if (current.prev().hasClass('sortable-item')) {
                    current.prev().before(current);
                    moveSortNo();
                }
            });
            // Down
            sortable.on('click', 'a.action-down', function(e) {
                e.preventDefault();
                var current = $(this).parents('li');
                if (current.next().hasClass('sortable-item')) {
                    current.next().after(current);
                    moveSortNo();
                }
            });

            sortable.on('click', 'a.action-edit', function(e) {
                e.preventDefault();
                var current = $(this).parents('li');
                current.find('.mode-view').addClass('d-none');
                current.find('.mode-edit').removeClass('d-none');
            });
            sortable.on('click', 'button.action-edit-cancel', function(e) {
                location.href = "/admin/class-category/class-category-list?classNameId={{ classNameId }}";
            });
            sortable.find('.is-invalid').each(function(e) {
                var current = $(this).parents('li');
                current.find('.mode-view').addClass('d-none');
                current.find('.mode-edit').removeClass('d-none');
            });

            // 削除モーダルのhrefとmessageの変更
            $('#DeleteModal').on('shown.bs.modal', function(event) {
                var target = $(event.relatedTarget);
                // hrefの変更
                $(this).find('[data-post-action="delete"]').attr('href', target.data('url'));

                // messageの変更
                $(this).find('p.modal-message').text(target.data('message'));
            });

        });
    </script>
{% endblock %}

{% block main %}
    <div class="c-contentsArea__cols">
        <div class="c-contentsArea__primaryCol">
            <div class="c-primaryCol">
                <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col"><span class="card-title">規格名</span></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="ex-class_category" class="card-body">
                        <div class="row mb-2">
                            <div class="col-auto"><span>規格名</span></div>
                            <div class="col-auto"><span></span></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row mb-2">
                            <div class="col-auto"><span>管理名</span></div>
                            <div class="col-auto"><span></span></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="c-outsideBlock">
                    <div class="c-outsideBlock__contents mb-2">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-12 text-right">
                                <div class="btn-group" role="group">
                                    <a class="btn btn-ec-regular" href="/admin/class-category/class-category-export?classNameId={{ classNameId }}">
                                        <i class="fa fa-cloud-download mr-1 text-secondary"></i>
                                        <span>CSVダウンロード</span>
                                    </a>
                                    <a class="btn btn-ec-regular" href="/admin/csv-config">
                                        <i class="fa fa-cog mr-1 text-secondary"></i>
                                        <span>CSV出力項目設定</span>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                    <div class="card-header"><span class="card-title">規格分類</span></div>
                    <div id="ex-class_category-edit" class="card-body p-0">
                        <div class="card rounded border-0">

                            <ul class="list-group list-group-flush sortable-container">
                                <li class="list-group-item">
                                    <form role="form" class="row" name="form1" id="form1" method="post" action="/admin/class-category/class-category-list?classNameId={{ classNameId }}">
                                        <div class="col-auto align-self-center">
                                            <span>分類名</span>
                                            <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-3 me-2">
                                            <input type="hidden" name="csrfToken" value="{{ csrfToken|default('') }}">
                                            {{ form.input('name')|raw }}
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-auto align-self-center"><span>管理名</span></div>
                                        <div class="col-3">
                                            {{ form.input('backend_name')|raw }}
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-auto">
                                            <button class="btn btn-ec-regular" type="submit">新規作成</button>
                                        </div>
                                    </form>
                                </li>
                                <li class="list-group-item">
                                    <div class="row">
                                        <div class="col-auto"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>
                                        <div class="col-auto"><strong>ID</strong></div>
                                        <div class="col-1"><strong>規格分類</strong></div>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                {% for ClassCategory in classCategories %}
                                    <li id="ex-class_category-{{ ClassCategory.classCategoryId }}" class="list-group-item sortable-item" data-classname-id="{{ ClassCategory.classNameId }}" data-id="{{ ClassCategory.classCategoryId }}" data-sort-no="">
                                        <div class="row justify-content-around mode-view">
                                            <div class="col-auto d-flex align-items-center"><i class="fa fa-bars text-ec-gray"></i></div>
                                            <div class="col-auto d-flex align-items-center">{{ ClassCategory.classCategoryId }}</div>
                                            <div class="col d-flex align-items-center">{{ ClassCategory.name }} ［管理名：］</div>
                                            <div class="col-auto text-end">
                                                <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon me-2 action-up {% if loop.first %}disabled{% endif %}" href="" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="上へ">
                                                    <i class="fa fa-arrow-up fa-lg text-secondary"></i>
                                                </a>
                                                <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon me-2 action-down {% if loop.last %}disabled{% endif %}" href="" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="下へ">
                                                    <i class="fa fa-arrow-down fa-lg text-secondary"></i>
                                                </a>
                                                <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon me-2 action-edit" href="" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="編集">
                                                    <i class="fa fa-pencil fa-lg text-secondary"></i>
                                                </a>
                                                <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon me-2 action-visible" href="/admin/toggle-visible?masterType=classCategory&class_name_id={{ ClassCategory.classNameId }}&rowId={{ ClassCategory.classCategoryId }}&_method=put"
                                                   data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="非表示中 | 表示にする"
                                                   data-confirm="false">
                                                    <i class="fa fa-toggle-off fa-lg text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                </a>
                                                <div class="d-inline-block me-2" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="削除">
                                                    <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#DeleteModal"
                                                       data-url="/admin/class-category/class-category?class_name_id={{ ClassCategory.classNameId }}&classCategoryId={{ ClassCategory.classCategoryId }}&_method=delete"
                                                       data-message="この操作はあとから取り消すことができません。「{{ ClassCategory.name }}」を削除してよろしいですか？">
                                                        <i class="fa fa-close fa-lg text-secondary"></i>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <form class="row d-none mode-edit" method="post" action="/admin/class-category/class-category-list?classNameId={{ ClassCategory.classNameId }}&classCategoryId={{ ClassCategory.classCategoryId }}">
                                            <input type="hidden" name="csrfToken" value="{{ csrfToken|default('') }}">
                                            <div class="col-3 me-2">
                                                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="name" value="{{ ClassCategory.name }}" data-origin-value="{{ ClassCategory.name }}">
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-auto align-self-center"><span>管理名</span></div>
                                            <div class="col-auto align-items-center">
                                                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="backend_name" value="" data-origin-value="">
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-auto align-items-center">
                                                <button class="btn btn-ec-conversion" type="submit">決定</button>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-auto align-items-center">
                                                <button class="btn btn-ec-sub action-edit-cancel" type="button">キャンセル</button>
                                            </div>
                                        </form>
                                    </li>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </ul>
                            <!-- 削除モーダル -->
                            <div class="modal fade" id="DeleteModal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog"
                                 aria-labelledby="DeleteModal" aria-hidden="true">
                                <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
                                    <div class="modal-content">
                                        <div class="modal-header">
                                            <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold">
                                                削除します
                                            </h5>
                                            <button class="btn-close" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">

                                            </button>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="modal-body text-start">
                                            <p class="text-start modal-message"><!-- jsでメッセージを挿入 --></p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="modal-footer">
                                            <button class="btn btn-ec-sub" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal">
                                                キャンセル
                                            </button>
                                            <a class="btn btn-ec-delete" href="#"
                                               data-confirm="false">
                                                削除
                                            </a>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p>項目の順番はドラッグ＆ドロップでも変更可能です。</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="c-conversionArea">
            <div class="c-conversionArea__container">
                <div class="row justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div class="c-conversionArea__leftBlockItem">
                            <a class="c-baseLink" href="/admin/class-name/class-name-list">
                                <i class="fa fa-backward" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>規格管理</span>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
